OL,3,GNEWSASurgeon calls for corporate       
OL,4,Ahomicide probe over claims patients    
OL,5,Aunnecessarily bled to death            
OL,7,FThe whistleblowing medic also leaked an
OL,8,Funpublished expert review from 2022    
OL,9,Fwhich found 19 avoidable deaths among  
OL,10,F45 patients in liver and pancreatic    
OL,11,Fsurgery, including some who bled to    
OL,12,Fdeath in the operating theatre because 
OL,13,Fof mistakes by surgeons.               
OL,15,FThe allegations come a week after a    
OL,16,Fscathing report found poor leadership  
OL,17,Fand culture at the NHS Grampian board. 
OL,18,FIn response to the latest allegations, 
OL,19,Fit said a thorough investigation had   
OL,20,Falready taken place and any new        
OL,21,Fevidence would be carefully considered.
